# ERP Strategy v2 — agent discovery (approved)

**Canonical document:** `docs/governance/erpnext/VISION_AND_INTENDED_USE.md` 
**Status:** `APPROVED — VERSION 2` (Anton van den Berg, 2026-08-14 12:54 +04:00). 
**Source:** issues #960 / #955 / #954 / #953. Do not treat chat memory as the strategy.

When a packet touches ERPNext, CRM/business records, finance, Projects, Support, proposals/quotations, automation authority, or source-of-truth boundaries, **read the canonical document before implementing**. Do not paste or fork the full doctrine into other files.

## Non-negotiables agents must know now

1. **Minimum viable ERP, correctly founded** — fewer modules, but masters/controls that later accounting and audit will rely on must be set up properly.
2. **ERPNext is authoritative** for financial/corporate business truth where standard ERPNext fit exists. CorpFlowAI execution/automation outside ERPNext must **reconcile rather than duplicate**.
3. **AI spend/supplier/quote gates:** zero default autonomous spend authority; Anton approves suppliers; every external quotation/proposal needs Anton approval before release (commercial content **and** rendered presentation).
4. **Outbound document lifecycle:** Draft → Review → Reject / Amend / Approve → Submit → Externally Share. Do not skip the approval gate.
5. **Prestige fast lane must not be blocked** by the broader ERP programme. Value-based pricing is allowed; Anton’s time is a real delivery cost; internal cost sanity still required.
6. **Accountant authority:** statutory/tax/payroll/Chart of Accounts and cutover/opening-balance decisions wait for the external accountant. Do not invent accounting policy.
7. **This approved Version 2 strategy authorizes no protected consequence:** no production accounting/tax/bank mutation, no schema/custom DocTypes, no env/secrets change, no live send, no paid-tool purchase, no public/client_production launch.

Unresolved questions stay recorded as open. Do not silently normalize them into configuration.
